{
  "$comment": "A null value with a Failed aggregate status reconciles as not_evaluable, never as zero and never as a residual (plan section 14.4 rule 4).",
  "$id": "https://archlens.dev/schemas/contribution_row-1.9.schema.json",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "One row of the per-file metric-contribution ledger: the already computed FileMetricResult components persisted before aggregation discards them (plan section 14). ArchLens implements no second metric calculation; derived metrics are recomputed from these raw components only for validation. This row contract is FIXED at Phase 1 and the Phase 8 container choice may not change any field name, type, status semantics, or ordering rule.\n\nArtifact Schema 1.7.0: `subject_key` is the logical join key for this row. The locator column becomes nullable because a local subject has no remote URL — a key that is sometimes absent was never a key.",
